## 5. Data Retention and Deletion

Because your study data is stored locally on your device:
- **How to Reset Data:** You can clear your study records, bookmarks, and test history at any time using the in-app "Reset Progress" option located in the App Settings.
- **How to Delete All Data:** You can completely delete all locally stored data at any time by clearing the App's storage via **Android Settings > Apps > USA Citizenship Test > Storage > Clear Data**, or by uninstalling the Application.
- For third-party advertising data managed by Google AdMob, you may reset your Advertising ID or opt out of personalized ads in your device settings.

